WEBVTT

00:08.230 --> 00:10.990
Those who have heard the Corpses song

00:11.490 --> 00:14.070
will die a mysterious death within nine days.

00:15.570 --> 00:19.370
She was one of those people
who happened to hear the song.

00:34.760 --> 00:35.680
Emiru...

00:45.230 --> 00:46.270
My...

00:46.900 --> 00:48.650
My Emiru...

01:00.120 --> 01:05.710
The Dark Metal

01:00.160 --> 01:00.200
The Dark Metal

01:05.710 --> 01:10.130
Night turns to day, and day turns to night. Our wishes have wilted away

01:10.130 --> 01:14.300
Where did the person I want to meet go?

01:14.300 --> 01:18.760
Interlocking these fingers with my beloved

01:18.760 --> 01:22.520
Even though I can't feel them, I continue to live

01:22.560 --> 01:27.150
When the flower's petals

01:27.150 --> 01:31.270
Are plucked off by the wind's playful gale

01:31.270 --> 01:35.740
They are scattered in every direction

01:35.740 --> 01:41.080
Even if you long for it

01:42.080 --> 01:46.790
Don't disappear, just don't

01:46.790 --> 01:50.590
I can even give everything else away if I have to

01:50.590 --> 01:55.420
You were there, and I was there with you

01:55.420 --> 01:59.760
Let me take in these memories

01:59.760 --> 02:06.680
These brief moments are connected, turning it into eternity

02:23.990 --> 02:29.040
Episode 6
Terror Fading Into Death

02:31.460 --> 02:32.380
Emiru!

02:38.510 --> 02:40.550
Akashi...

02:40.550 --> 02:43.970
Defeat the Corpse...

02:44.390 --> 02:45.350
The Corpse?

02:46.350 --> 02:49.190
The Corpses are a symbol of the Lightless Realm.

02:49.600 --> 02:51.400
For what reason was it born?

02:51.770 --> 02:53.730
What does it seek?

02:54.570 --> 02:56.690
Its existence is shrouded in mystery.

02:58.900 --> 03:00.240
Emiru!

03:00.240 --> 03:01.660
However...

03:02.200 --> 03:06.700
The Reaper is the one thing that can defeat the Corpses.

03:11.000 --> 03:17.210
It's not my fault. It's not my fault.
It's not my fault. It's not my fault.

03:17.210 --> 03:19.420
It isn't! It really isn't!

03:19.420 --> 03:26.100
I'm sorry. I'm sorry. I'm so sorry...

03:26.760 --> 03:28.600
According to the doctor's report,

03:28.600 --> 03:31.060
the Lightless Realm's encroachment effect

03:31.060 --> 03:35.060
had already started to eat away
at her body days before all of this.

03:35.060 --> 03:36.480
Her entire body...

03:36.480 --> 03:38.530
turned into Necrometal this morning.

03:39.190 --> 03:40.990
Meaning what?

03:40.990 --> 03:43.610
That she has passed away.

03:46.030 --> 03:47.160
Impossible.

03:47.830 --> 03:49.120
Are you serious?

03:52.670 --> 03:54.290
My terror...

03:54.290 --> 03:56.380
There's no way she'd die!

03:56.670 --> 04:00.840
That just can't be enough to kill her!

04:00.840 --> 04:04.050
They're handing the cadaver to the pathologist now.

04:04.050 --> 04:06.050
Unfortunately, it's too late...

04:06.390 --> 04:09.220
So what you're saying is that
she's a valuable research sample...

04:11.430 --> 04:13.690
Is this really it?

04:22.950 --> 04:24.160
Why...

04:37.130 --> 04:38.290
Akashi...

04:39.000 --> 04:42.220
You know, there's something I want to show you...

04:44.930 --> 04:47.470
I want you to see it...

04:49.640 --> 04:52.020
That's the only way I can see.

04:53.560 --> 04:57.400
I wish you were the one I synchronized with.

04:58.810 --> 05:02.820
She was trying to tell me something.

05:04.150 --> 05:05.240
But I...

05:16.040 --> 05:17.880
Akashi...

05:17.880 --> 05:20.380
Defeat the Corpse...

05:30.100 --> 05:31.310
Emiru...

05:31.310 --> 05:31.720
Dammit!

05:40.110 --> 05:41.770
"I couldn't do anything."

05:44.780 --> 05:46.740
I heard your heart, Sasame.

05:49.530 --> 05:52.030
By coming here and meeting everyone,

05:52.030 --> 05:55.910
you felt like you could finally change and do something.

06:00.630 --> 06:02.170
But it's all right.

06:02.170 --> 06:04.340
I'm sure there's something you can still do from here on.

06:05.630 --> 06:07.840
You want to talk to Akashi, right?

06:07.840 --> 06:09.090
Why not try talking to him?

06:10.760 --> 06:12.510
You might be able to change.

06:15.600 --> 06:17.230
Don't come here!

06:18.940 --> 06:20.770
What's happening to me?

06:20.770 --> 06:21.940
No!

06:22.570 --> 06:26.280
I guess this is about it.

06:26.280 --> 06:29.740
There aren't any new
findings from the footage.

06:30.070 --> 06:33.740
I hadn't heard anything about
living humans creating Admonitions!

06:33.740 --> 06:37.620
And of all people, it was a member of the Lightless Realm's investigative team.

06:38.210 --> 06:40.040
Well, you're right.

06:40.830 --> 06:43.590
I completely understand what you want to say.

06:45.090 --> 06:49.260
Now we won't know when or
where Admonitions will appear.

06:49.260 --> 06:51.680
It's just like you say.

06:51.680 --> 06:54.760
Strengthen the defenses around IX headquarters!

06:54.760 --> 06:57.600
I'll have the pilots be on a 24-hour watch!

06:57.600 --> 06:59.190
Please wait!

06:59.190 --> 07:02.480
They just lost a member, so anything further...

07:04.150 --> 07:06.230
...would be impossible.

07:06.230 --> 07:07.740
R-Right!

07:07.740 --> 07:09.610
We should re-evaluate the project and—

07:09.610 --> 07:14.030
Part of their job is to be students,
so a 24-hour watch is quite impossible.

07:14.830 --> 07:16.450
Let's see...

07:16.450 --> 07:20.710
How about as an experiment, we have
them trade off doing night security shifts?

07:20.710 --> 07:22.540
I don't care what you do.

07:22.540 --> 07:26.090
We just can't pick up and leave so easily!

07:26.090 --> 07:29.090
We need to prioritize their mental health first.

07:29.670 --> 07:31.340
It's settled then!

07:31.340 --> 07:33.470
I'll leave the formations to you.

07:33.470 --> 07:36.100
Please relay things to the pilots too.

07:36.100 --> 07:38.020
Roger that.

07:38.020 --> 07:39.560
This can't be...

07:39.930 --> 07:45.520
Overcoming a member's death is also a necessary part of training.

07:49.070 --> 07:51.570
Minashi and Heito aren't here.

07:51.570 --> 07:53.200
Where'd they go?

07:54.660 --> 07:55.910
All right.

07:55.910 --> 07:57.740
I'll tell them later.

07:57.740 --> 08:01.160
Starting tonight, we'll have you
guys doing rotating night patrols.

08:01.160 --> 08:04.750
of IX headquarters and the general Kujicho area.

08:04.750 --> 08:06.960
In other words...

08:06.960 --> 08:09.920
We have to stay up all night waiting for them.

08:10.260 --> 08:12.510
Iwato and Minashi tonight.

08:12.510 --> 08:14.890
Mahmu and Sasame will assist in the command module.

08:14.890 --> 08:17.050
Raika, stand by for now.

08:17.050 --> 08:18.760
Dammit!

08:18.760 --> 08:22.600
Akashi, I want you to stand by
the Argent tonight just in case.

08:26.440 --> 08:28.820
There's no turning back now.

08:30.780 --> 08:33.650
Even if all they're doing is using us,

08:33.650 --> 08:36.240
we have to make sure to do this till the end.

08:36.240 --> 08:37.660
For Emiru's sake.

08:44.120 --> 08:45.210
Akashi, you too.

08:45.710 --> 08:46.960
I know that!

08:50.800 --> 08:52.260
Akashi!

09:09.150 --> 09:10.360
You want something?

09:11.400 --> 09:13.860
You can't hear my heart?

09:15.570 --> 09:18.530
I feel Emiru.

09:19.070 --> 09:22.040
And I'm sure you do too, Isaku Heito.

09:22.040 --> 09:25.750
I should be the only one
who feels Emiru's terror.

09:26.960 --> 09:28.040
Roger.

09:45.060 --> 09:49.020
I keep seeing these aberrant images.

09:49.520 --> 09:50.860
I can also see the redness of blood.

09:51.730 --> 09:54.110
I don't know what you had it do,

09:54.440 --> 09:56.490
but that must be from when it killed.

09:56.490 --> 09:58.570
That can't possibly be true!

09:58.860 --> 10:01.660
What the hell is this thing...

10:04.540 --> 10:06.160
About Minashi and Heito...

10:06.160 --> 10:09.000
I did look around for them.

10:09.000 --> 10:11.790
We'll deal with the two of them on our end.

10:12.460 --> 10:14.210
Let's change the formation for tonight.

10:16.470 --> 10:19.300
Then in Minashi's place...

10:19.300 --> 10:20.300
Mahmu.

10:21.600 --> 10:23.560
Your skills are subpar,

10:23.560 --> 10:25.220
but we have no choice now.

10:25.220 --> 10:26.480
I'll go on the command module too.

10:27.350 --> 10:29.230
Um, I...

10:30.650 --> 10:33.360
The four of you will stand by for now.

10:34.190 --> 10:35.780
Um, excuse—

10:35.780 --> 10:36.650
We're counting on you.

10:36.650 --> 10:37.440
Yes.

10:37.440 --> 10:40.110
No, wait...

10:40.110 --> 10:42.950
I don't think I'm that good...

10:42.950 --> 10:45.660
I'm pretty sure I'll make a mistake, I think...

10:45.660 --> 10:46.790
I think...

10:49.870 --> 10:50.830
Don't worry.

10:50.830 --> 10:52.290
I'll be here too just in case.

10:57.510 --> 10:59.340
You want to talk to Akashi, right?

11:00.680 --> 11:02.800
You might be able to change.

11:05.930 --> 11:07.850
Regarding Minashi and Heito,

11:07.850 --> 11:10.480
it's possible they headed to the lab.

11:10.480 --> 11:12.020
I know that.

11:12.020 --> 11:14.190
We'll leave them be for now.

11:14.650 --> 11:16.280
Roger that.

11:29.160 --> 11:30.210
It's this way.

11:33.330 --> 11:34.500
This guy...

11:43.050 --> 11:44.180
Akashi-kun.

11:47.810 --> 11:49.140
Sasame...

11:58.940 --> 12:00.190
We're close.

12:03.410 --> 12:04.490
Why...

12:05.370 --> 12:06.870
You say somethin'?

12:10.330 --> 12:11.620
Why...

12:12.830 --> 12:14.120
This voice...

12:14.630 --> 12:16.420
I don't want to die.

12:17.540 --> 12:18.920
So why...

12:19.710 --> 12:20.760
Emiru.

12:23.930 --> 12:26.220
She was alive after all!

12:26.220 --> 12:30.060
The terror that I love!

12:30.060 --> 12:31.730
It's so dark...

12:32.480 --> 12:33.940
and scary...

12:33.940 --> 12:35.480
Is it dark?

12:35.480 --> 12:37.190
Yup, that's right.

12:37.190 --> 12:40.530
So scary! It's so scary!

12:40.530 --> 12:41.070
What else?

12:41.400 --> 12:42.650
Is there anything else?

12:42.650 --> 12:44.780
C'mon. Tell me more, Emiru!

12:49.240 --> 12:51.120
Looking at the stars?

12:51.120 --> 12:51.910
Yeah.

12:53.160 --> 12:54.160
And you, Sasame?

12:55.580 --> 12:58.920
I wanted to see the stars as well.

12:59.800 --> 13:00.920
I see.

13:02.090 --> 13:07.390
It was a lot of fun playing with fireworks during that night.

13:08.350 --> 13:09.100
Yeah.

13:17.100 --> 13:18.560
It was fun.

13:20.070 --> 13:23.190
We saw a meteor shower
while on that deserted island.

13:28.410 --> 13:29.120
Yeah.

13:31.290 --> 13:32.660
It was beautiful.

13:35.710 --> 13:37.920
As I pilot the Reaper more,

13:37.920 --> 13:41.920
I feel like I won't be able to see the
night sky with you all like that again.

13:45.220 --> 13:52.010
Even if it's for Emiru, I don't think any of us want to pilot a Vess ever again.

13:57.100 --> 14:00.310
Everyone else may be thinking that for now,

14:00.730 --> 14:04.780
but you still want to pilot the Reaper.

14:06.650 --> 14:08.110
The Reaper?

14:08.910 --> 14:09.780
I do?

14:12.870 --> 14:15.080
I-I just...

14:15.830 --> 14:18.750
Akashi-kun, you were
smiling a minute ago.

14:19.960 --> 14:24.460
But you're thinking
about someone else's smile.

14:25.010 --> 14:26.880
You want to know the reason why.

14:28.470 --> 14:30.800
That's the hunch I got...

14:30.800 --> 14:34.180
But if I were to get on a Vess,

14:34.180 --> 14:37.560
would I be able to figure
out what you want to know?

14:38.690 --> 14:39.560
Why...

14:40.310 --> 14:41.860
Akashi-kun...

14:41.860 --> 14:44.690
I want you to keep smiling like you were earlier.

14:46.240 --> 14:47.570
Sasame...

14:49.200 --> 14:51.280
I don't want to die.

14:51.280 --> 14:53.240
Akashi...

14:57.410 --> 15:00.750
Defeat it for me, Akashi.

15:02.380 --> 15:05.000
It's not Akashi at all!

15:05.000 --> 15:06.340
What is this?!

15:06.340 --> 15:07.050
Heito.

15:08.670 --> 15:11.140
The voice will go away soon.

15:13.180 --> 15:14.560
That's the feeling I get.

15:15.140 --> 15:19.180
Please defeat it, Akashi.

15:19.180 --> 15:23.400
Defeat the Corpse, Akashi!

15:23.810 --> 15:24.610
Emiru...

15:25.360 --> 15:27.070
Come on, run along!

15:27.070 --> 15:28.690
That voice...

15:28.690 --> 15:30.780
It was Emiru, right?

15:32.740 --> 15:34.070
Akashi-kun!

15:56.050 --> 15:58.390
That thing's not an Admonition!

15:58.970 --> 16:02.850
Requesting Team Gargouille to
head to evacuation quadrant four.

16:02.850 --> 16:04.060
The target is...

16:04.060 --> 16:04.860
What?

16:05.520 --> 16:06.610
Impossible!

16:06.610 --> 16:10.360
That Corpse has such uncanny timing.

16:11.450 --> 16:14.030
Have them scramble at once.

16:14.030 --> 16:15.120
That's too reckless!

16:15.120 --> 16:19.450
Akashi's synchronicity with the Argent is still unstable.

16:19.450 --> 16:21.330
What about the pilot selection?

16:22.290 --> 16:25.540
Those on standby are our best best at present.

16:25.540 --> 16:26.920
Then that's fine.

16:26.920 --> 16:28.800
But if their enemy is a Corpse—

16:28.800 --> 16:31.300
They're going out!

16:31.300 --> 16:33.050
Get a grip, Mahmu!

16:36.050 --> 16:37.260
Mahmu, get on—

16:41.350 --> 16:43.600
Impossible, impossible, impossible...

16:43.600 --> 16:44.850
Fine then.

16:44.850 --> 16:45.900
I'll get on.

16:45.900 --> 16:47.310
Please wait!

16:49.020 --> 16:50.360
I'll get on.

16:51.320 --> 16:53.900
Get as much distance
as you can from the target!

17:00.740 --> 17:02.450
Shit, it's heading towards...

17:02.450 --> 17:04.580
The Corpse is headed this way!

17:05.790 --> 17:06.670
Why?!

17:06.670 --> 17:09.630
Looks like we can skip the trouble of going out.

17:09.630 --> 17:13.470
But right now the Argent can't exercise its full potential.

17:13.470 --> 17:15.590
We should avoid any means of combat and—

17:15.590 --> 17:19.850
The Argent's equipment was made for fighting against any Corpse in mind.

17:19.850 --> 17:22.310
We have to use it in order to see how it goes.

17:22.930 --> 17:24.810
Argent has booted up.

17:30.110 --> 17:30.770
Akashi-kun?

17:31.900 --> 17:32.780
Sasame?

17:43.830 --> 17:45.210
Suzaki here.

17:45.210 --> 17:47.500
All units gather at the academy gates!

17:47.500 --> 17:48.880
The target is a Corpse.

17:48.880 --> 17:50.340
Corpse?

17:50.630 --> 17:52.550
Not an Admonition?

17:55.970 --> 17:58.550
They want to greet the Corpse with gunfire?

17:58.550 --> 18:00.180
Sasame-san...

18:16.740 --> 18:17.740
Corpse...

18:29.370 --> 18:31.080
Oh man...

18:31.080 --> 18:33.090
This is nothing like an Admonition.

18:33.800 --> 18:35.840
This is a Corpse...

18:36.380 --> 18:39.800
The objective is merely to hold back the Corpse's invasion.

18:39.800 --> 18:42.050
Hold back? How are we supposed to do that?!

18:42.050 --> 18:46.600
The two Vesses will use head-on suppression fire as the Argent approaches from the side!

18:47.480 --> 18:49.190
Defeat it...

18:49.690 --> 18:53.320
Defeat the Corpse.

18:53.320 --> 18:54.440
No...

18:54.440 --> 18:56.190
Wait, hold on!

18:56.190 --> 18:58.150
You can't go yet, Emiru!

18:58.150 --> 18:59.700
I don't have enough!

18:59.700 --> 19:02.070
This terror isn't enough for me at all!

19:02.070 --> 19:04.410
Not even close to enough!

19:06.080 --> 19:06.500
Here he is!

19:06.500 --> 19:08.000
The other one's here too!

19:10.420 --> 19:12.170
Let me go!

19:11.040 --> 19:13.000
Stop fussing around!

19:20.930 --> 19:22.890
It's not working at all.

19:31.350 --> 19:32.310
It's so fast!

19:34.980 --> 19:37.320
On top of that, it's ignoring us?

19:50.120 --> 19:51.580
Dammit!

19:51.960 --> 19:54.710
Defeat the Corpse...

19:56.210 --> 19:57.670
Akashi, calm down!

19:58.050 --> 19:59.920
Your resonance levels are all over!

20:05.300 --> 20:06.560
You can't, Akashi!

20:14.860 --> 20:15.900
Akashi!

20:27.530 --> 20:28.450
This is bad!

20:28.450 --> 20:29.240
Akashi!

20:30.200 --> 20:31.660
Akashi-kun!

20:31.660 --> 20:32.660
Hold on, Sasame!

20:38.380 --> 20:39.500
Sasame!

20:48.350 --> 20:49.470
Sasame!

20:52.890 --> 20:53.850
What the hell...

20:53.850 --> 20:54.810
Dammit!

20:55.350 --> 20:59.150
I have to save Sasame...

20:59.520 --> 21:01.570
I have to save her!

21:05.320 --> 21:06.030
Akashi...

21:23.510 --> 21:26.220
My terror is dead...

21:26.930 --> 21:30.640
She... Emiru just died.

21:30.640 --> 21:32.430
Hey...

21:35.020 --> 21:36.600
Give it back...

21:36.600 --> 21:38.520
Give it back to me!

21:38.520 --> 21:39.690
My precious...

21:39.690 --> 21:42.110
My precious terror!

22:17.270 --> 22:21.690
We've had a night just like this one in the past.

22:22.190 --> 22:26.650
Its brightness fascinates anyone who even gets a glimpse of it.

22:27.650 --> 22:32.080
A fleeting yet beautiful light of sorrow.

22:44.800 --> 22:55.430
Throwing away all my excuses, I traced over my abrased heart

22:55.430 --> 22:59.980
In the coldness of the locker room,

22:59.980 --> 23:06.440
Was an unfulfilled promise, locked away

23:06.940 --> 23:12.910
Dispel the darkness in this fallen world,

23:12.910 --> 23:17.450
And give me a reason why I should continue living

23:17.450 --> 23:22.830
The meaning of good-byes, the expectations of people,

23:22.830 --> 23:27.710
And the melodies that we played while never crossing paths

23:27.710 --> 23:33.430
I know I must not run away. The only path is straight ahead

23:33.430 --> 23:37.930
Even if this turns out to be a mistake

23:37.930 --> 23:43.520
The whirlpools of destiny will consume all loneliness

23:43.520 --> 23:51.610
It is an unerasable scar, an egoism that cannot be discarded

24:05.000 --> 24:10.010
Episode 7

24:05.000 --> 24:10.010
Command of Solitude
